{"collection":{"version":"1.1","href":"http://images-api.nasa.gov/search?q=Gemini+aircraft+carrier+recovery&media_type=image&year_start=1965&year_end=1966&page_size=25","items":[{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-19532/collection.json","data":[{"center":"JSC","date_created":"1965-02-24T00:00:00Z","description":"The Gemini-4 Astronauts is shown being hoisted aboard the Aircraft Carrier USS Wasp.  The flotation collar is still attached to the spacecraft.          DOWNRANGE RECOVERY AREA, ATLANTIC OCEAN            B&W","media_type":"image","nasa_id":"s65-19532","title":"RECOVERY - GEMINI-TITAN (GT)-4 - ATLANTIC"}],"links":[{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-19532/s65-19532~medium.jpg","rel":"alternate","render":"image","width":1017,"size":200000,"height":1280},{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-19532/s65-19532~small.jpg","rel":"alternate","render":"image","width":508,"size":61000,"height":640},{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-19532/s65-19532~thumb.jpg","rel":"preview","render":"image","width":508,"size":61000,"height":640},{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-19532/s65-19532~large.jpg","rel":"alternate","render":"image","width":1526,"size":410000,"height":1920},{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-19532/s65-19532~orig.jpg","rel":"canonical","render":"image","height":5646,"width":4488,"size":3400000}]},{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-19536/collection.json","data":[{"center":"JSC","date_created":"1965-02-24T00:00:00Z","description":"The Gemini-4 Astronauts is shown being hoisted aboard the aircraft carrier USS Wasp.  The flotation collar is still attached to the spacecraft.        DOWNRANGE RECOVERY AREA, ATLANTIC OCEAN          B&W","media_type":"image","nasa_id":"s65-19536","title":"RECOVERY - GEMINI-TITAN (GT)-4 - ATLANTIC"}],"links":[{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-19536/s65-19536~medium.jpg","rel":"alternate","render":"image","width":880,"size"